# Local-only host port bindings.
#
# Normal local API entrypoint:
#   http://localhost:42100
#
# The other *_SERVICE_HOST_PORT values are debug-only direct service ports.
# Keep service/container ports unchanged for deployment and service-to-service
# URLs, for example http://booking-service:3003 or redis://redis:6379.
